          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "effectiveDateTime": "2025-11-22",
        "valueString": "Head cold for approximately 5 days. Initially scratchy sore throat, now nasal congestion, rhinorrhoea and mild dry cough; feels a bit washed out. Wants to check that illness is not worsening.",
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Patient questions whether new scented washing powder or air conditioning at shops could be a trigger."
          }
        ]
